/-- The anisotropic radius `|ξ|^{1/α} + |η|^{1/β}`. -/
def anisoRadius (α β : ℕ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℝ := |p.1| ^ ((α : ℝ)⁻¹) + |p.2| ^ ((β : ℝ)⁻¹)

/-- `m` is smooth on `ℝ^2 ∖ {0}` with `|∂_ξ^k ∂_η^ℓ m(ξ,η)| ≤ C (|ξ|^{1/α} + |η|^{1/β})^{-αk-βℓ}`
for `k + ℓ ≤ N` (`symest`); the partial derivatives are the iterated Fréchet derivatives along
`k` copies of `(1,0)` followed by `ℓ` copies of `(0,1)`. -/
